  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For the system of linear equations</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>which of the following is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NOT</mi></math> correct?</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "o9wp3",
      "text": "<p>It has unique solution if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "zzW5s",
      "text": "<p>It has infinitely many solutions if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "wFKNf",
      "text": "<p>It has infinitely many solutions if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
