      "text": "<p>It has unique solution if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>",
      "image": null,
